#ASSERT `s 234(1)(b) the claimant had suffered loss by reason of the difference in price` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 234(1)(b) the claimant had suffered loss by reason of the difference in price` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

