#ASSERT `s 234(1A)(a) the contravening person has contravened section 199, 200 or 201 by a false statement or a concealed fact` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 234(1A)(a) the contravening person has contravened section 199, 200 or 201 by a false statement or a concealed fact` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
